This package is an additive successor to PR163 at e1813796ef5c3ca38c5dd7b9e8d81b3908ff5997. Its complete corrected NOTICE and source closure are retained unchanged. All construction, partner-pair decoder, carrier matching, gauge, source-sharing, frame compiler, complex supplier, paid moment, row-stock, atom-toll and balanced-layout lineage recorded there remains credited to the original authors.

The new contribution is the deterministic exact-rational search and verification of 168 further operation-frame descents, its finite prime-factor witnesses, and the resulting complete paid moment and assembly recalculation. No prerequisite construction is claimed as new here. `prime_check.py` retains the exact Bareiss determinant method of the prerequisite bit prime-witness script; `make_plan.py` and `verify.py` reuse the pinned prerequisite checker, moment arithmetic and paid assembly APIs. They leave the prerequisite files unchanged.
